From fc26f521d567b318c3a6649fb55e79a5f882d0a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:52:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Keep URLs out of handover errors, accept only Apple TV
 targets, wake before VLC

- safe_error() strips any scheme:// link from handover error text and logs
  (VLC, AirPlay, direct, discovery, fallback, stream lookup)
- _resolve_apple_tv_entity() only accepts apple_tv platform entities; a
  wrong-platform target falls back to the configured default or raises
  not_apple_tv_entity naming the entity and its platform
- VLC handover turns on a sleeping Apple TV, waits until it reports awake
  (max 30 s) and then wake_delay seconds (default 15) before launching VLC
- new optional wake_delay field on stremio.handover_to_apple_tv

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019RannaXh39jzCruFEkvtPf
